    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Three performances only!\nTickets from $94.75.\nA GIRL’S DREAM. A WOMAN’S JOURNEY. A QUEEN’S LEGACY.\n\n\nTINA – The Tina Turner Musical is the inspiring true story of a woman who defied racism, sexism, and ageism to become the global Queen of Rock ’n’ Roll. This smash-hit stage production celebrates Tin"
