        "@value": "Men of the Deeps is a world-renowned choir of working and retired coal miners from Cape Breton, Nova Scotia, who bring the stories of their lives underground to the stage through powerful song and heartfelt storytelling. For over 50 years, they’ve shared the rich culture, resilience, and camaraderie"
