        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Experience an uplifting evening with Theresa Caputo—the acclaimed Long Island Medium—live at Centre in the Square on September 3, 2025. For over 30 years, Caputo has comforted audiences worldwide, delivering powerful messages from loved ones and blending heartfelt stories with lighthearted moments. "
